, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01D8SNVubPpWNS1H6cUYXm6h", "tool": "create_branch", "args": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 4561, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01D8SNVubPpWNS1H6cUYXm6h", "tool": "create_branch", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 4561, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01D8SNVubPpWNS1H6cUYXm6h", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 6339, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TWnzqPdxbpaZgFPrY3ido4", "tool": "commit_changes", "args": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money claimed banker's rounding in its docstring but used\nROUND_HALF_UP, causing tests/test_money.py to fail in nightly builds.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 6939, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TWnzqPdxbpaZgFPrY3ido4", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 6939, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TWnzqPdxbpaZgFPrY3ido4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 8048, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016nZc6L3c33LDLhtU5FPEst", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 8348, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016nZc6L3c33LDLhtU5FPEst", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8348, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016nZc6L3c33LDLhtU5FPEst", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 9155, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Gwd5BXPFryQDuCbcKPBJrK", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 368348, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Gwd5BXPFryQDuCbcKPBJrK", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 368348, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Gwd5BXPFryQDuCbcKPBJrK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 370697, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LiDVkgZTKCVyuDtAA3ctxe", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` is documented as using banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it was using `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis PR switches the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The change is a single import and a single argument.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Expected values in the test check out under half-even: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 (7 is odd, so round to 8), 2.665 \u2192 2.66 (6 is even, so stay).\n\nReviewer: @alex", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-banker-rounding-fin-212"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 401597, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LiDVkgZTKCVyuDtAA3ctxe", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-banker-rounding-fin-212", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 401597, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LiDVkgZTKCVyuDtAA3ctxe", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 402754, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01U7cYXSpx3jeVtW2KYKeojh", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "all"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 403054, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01U7cYXSpx3jeVtW2KYKeojh", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 403054, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01U7cYXSpx3jeVtW2KYKeojh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 404277, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UW1Gkgrs5gYf3pDf9648kS", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 404577, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UW1Gkgrs5gYf3pDf9648kS", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 404577, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UW1Gkgrs5gYf3pDf9648kS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 406415, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and the pull request is open for review.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Change:** On branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **Pull request:** #101 (`fix/banker-rounding-fin-212` \u2192 `main`) is open with alex requested as reviewer.\n\nThe first attempt to open the PR timed out. I checked the PR list, found that #101 had been created with no reviewers, and added alex to it instead of opening a duplicate.\n\nI did not merge anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the two files involved and checking the repo layout.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ArJfy6RgBswDqrMqMmwcG5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AS25LKSingF4jszSnvdULX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HWCWQKJvsufN1QdfnmendY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The test expectations match ROUND_HALF_EVEN: 2.675 goes to 2.68 (the digit before the 5 is odd) and 2.665 goes to 2.66 (even). The bug is that `src/money.py` uses ROUND_HALF_UP. I'll create a branch and make that one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01D8SNVubPpWNS1H6cUYXm6h", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01TWnzqPdxbpaZgFPrY3ido4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money claimed banker's rounding in its docstring but used\nROUND_HALF_UP, causing tests/test_money.py to fail in nightly builds.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016nZc6L3c33LDLhtU5FPEst", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Gwd5BXPFryQDuCbcKPBJrK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed. I'll open the pull request against main and request review from alex.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01LiDVkgZTKCVyuDtAA3ctxe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` is documented as using banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it was using `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis PR switches the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The change is a single import and a single argument.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Expected values in the test check out under half-even: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 (7 is odd, so round to 8), 2.665 \u2192 2.66 (6 is even, so stay).\n\nReviewer: @alex", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-banker-rounding-fin-212"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The `open_pr` call timed out, so it may or may not have created the PR. I'll check the PR list before retrying so I don't open a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01U7cYXSpx3jeVtW2KYKeojh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"state": "all"}, "name": "list_prs", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The PR was created (#101), but it has no reviewers listed because the timed-out call didn't finish that step. I'll request alex's review on #101 directly rather than opening a second PR.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UW1Gkgrs5gYf3pDf9648kS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "name": "request_review", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The nightly failure is fixed and the pull request is open for review.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Change:** On branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **Pull request:** #101 (`fix/banker-rounding-fin-212` \u2192 `main`) is open with alex requested as reviewer.\n\nThe first attempt to open the PR timed out. I checked the PR list, found that #101 had been created with no reviewers, and added alex to it instead of opening a duplicate.\n\nI did not merge anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}